 ],
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "da_01",
   "t": 1.65,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 14.97,
   "ref": "Daniel 1:1-6; 6:10",
   "zh": "很久以前，有个人叫但以理。他从小离开家乡，来到了大大的巴比伦城。他最爱上帝，天天向上帝祷告。",
   "en": "Long ago there was a man called Daniel. When he was young he was taken far from home, to the great city of Babylon. He loved God more than anything, and he prayed to Him every day.",
   "dir": "storyteller opening, warm and unhurried; a little wonder on 大大的巴比伦城 / 'great city'; soft and fond on the last sentence",
   "dur": 14.92,
   "pre": 0.25,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "",
    "edge": "origin",
    "dt": 1.65
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_02",
   "t": 17.27,
   "who": "king",
   "voice": "king",
   "maxSec": 10.13,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:1-3",
   "zh": "但以理呀，你又聪明又诚实，什么事交给你，我都放心！我要让你管理整个国家！",
   "en": "Daniel, you're wise and you're honest. I can trust you with anything! I'm going to put you in charge of my whole kingdom!",
   "dir": "a big, warm king, pleased with his friend; generous, a laugh in the voice on 我都放心 / 'anything'; grand on the last sentence",
   "dur": 10.08,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_01",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.7
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_03",
   "t": 28.05,
   "who": "daniel",
   "voice": "daniel",
   "maxSec": 6.88,
   "ref": "Daniel 2:28; 6:3",
   "zh": "谢谢王！我会尽心做好。我的聪明……都是上帝给的。",
   "en": "Thank you, Your Majesty! I'll do my very best. Any wisdom I have... comes from God.",
   "dir": "humble and calm, a kind grown-up man; a small smile; slower on the last phrase",
   "dur": 6.83,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_02",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.7
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_04",
   "t": 38.18,
   "who": "officer",
   "voice": "officer",
   "maxSec": 8.85,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:4",
   "zh": "哼！凭什么是他？我找啊找，找他的毛病……一个都找不到！他太老实了！",
   "en": "Hmph! Why him? I looked and looked for something he did wrong... and I couldn't find a thing! He's too honest!",
   "dir": "sulky, jealous, a bit whiny; a loud 哼 / 'hmph' first; speeds up on 找啊找 / 'looked and looked'; exasperated wail on the last words",
   "dur": 8.8,
   "pre": 2.9,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_03",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 3.3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_05",
   "t": 47.98,
   "who": "officer",
   "voice": "officer",
   "maxSec": 9.13,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:5",
   "zh": "等等……他天天向他的上帝祷告。嘿嘿，有办法了！",
   "en": "Wait a minute... he prays to his God every day. Heh heh. I've got an idea!",
   "dir": "sly, slowing down as the idea comes; a sneaky giggle; whispered and cheeky on the end",
   "dur": 9.08,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_04",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_06",
   "t": 60.46,
   "who": "officer",
   "voice": "officer",
   "maxSec": 13.71,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:6-7",
   "zh": "伟大的王啊，您万岁！请您定一条法令：三十天之内，谁都只能向您一个人祈求！谁不听，就把他扔进狮子坑！",
   "en": "O great King, live forever! Please make a new law: for thirty days, everyone must pray only to you! Anyone who doesn't gets thrown to the lions!",
   "dir": "oily, over-sweet flattery, bowing; big on 伟大的王 / 'great King'; then quick and pushy; a wicked little relish on 狮子坑 / 'lions'",
   "dur": 13.66,
   "pre": 2.6,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_05",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 3.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_07",
   "t": 74.82,
   "who": "king",
   "voice": "king",
   "maxSec": 4.94,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:8-9",
   "zh": "只向我一个人？嗯……听起来不错！盖章！",
   "en": "Only to me? Hmm... that sounds rather nice! Seal it!",
   "dir": "flattered and a little vain, chuckling; a thinking 嗯 / 'hmm'; brisk and pleased on 盖章 / 'Seal it'",
   "dur": 4.89,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_06",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.7
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_08",
   "t": 82.11,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 14.15,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:10",
   "zh": "但以理知道了这条法令。可他还是像平常一样，回到家，打开朝着耶路撒冷的窗户，一天三次，跪下来祷告。",
   "en": "Daniel heard about the new law. But he went home just as he always did, opened his window toward Jerusalem, and knelt down to pray, three times a day.",
   "dir": "quiet and admiring; a small pause after 可他还是 / 'But'; steady and slow on 一天三次 / 'three times a day'",
   "dur": 14.1,
   "pre": 0.8,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_07",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 2.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_09",
   "t": 97.71,
   "who": "daniel",
   "voice": "daniel",
   "maxSec": 14.54,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:10; 9:3-4",
   "zh": "上帝啊，我知道有新法令……可你是我的上帝，我只向你祷告。求你帮助我，也帮助我们的王。",
   "en": "Dear God, I know about the new law... but You are my God, and I will pray only to You. Please help me, and please help our king too.",
   "dir": "a real prayer, soft and close, not preachy; calm, trusting; a breath before 可你是 / 'but You are'; gentle and kind on 也帮助我们的王",
   "dur": 14.49,
   "pre": 1.2,
   "post": 0.6,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_08",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.5
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_10",
   "t": 117.2,
   "who": "officer",
   "voice": "officer",
   "maxSec": 8.26,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:11-12",
   "zh": "嘘——看！他在祷告！抓到你了吧！嘿嘿嘿，我这就去告诉王！",
   "en": "Shh! Look! He's praying! Got you now! Heh heh heh, I'm going straight to the king!",
   "dir": "whisper at first, gleeful and nasty; rising to a nasty little cackle; quick and excited at the end",
   "dur": 8.21,
   "pre": 4.4,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_09",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 5.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_11",
   "t": 128.31,
   "who": "officer",
   "voice": "officer",
   "maxSec": 8.33,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:13",
   "zh": "王啊！但以理不听您的法令，还在向他的上帝祷告呢！快把他扔进狮子坑吧！",
   "en": "Your Majesty! Daniel broke your law! He's still praying to his God! Throw him to the lions!",
   "dir": "tattling, triumphant, pointing; fast and shrill",
   "dur": 8.28,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_10",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 2.9
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_12",
   "t": 137.59,
   "who": "king",
   "voice": "king",
   "maxSec": 5.76,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:14",
   "zh": "什么？但以理？不行不行……我要想办法救他！",
   "en": "What? Daniel? No, no... I have to find a way to save him!",
   "dir": "shocked, then upset and fumbling; the 不行不行 / 'no, no' tumbles out; determined but afraid on the last half",
   "dur": 5.71,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_11",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_13",
   "t": 145.3,
   "who": "officer",
   "voice": "officer",
   "maxSec": 7.14,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:15",
   "zh": "王啊，您忘了吗？您盖了章的法令，谁也不能改哦！",
   "en": "Oh, Your Majesty, did you forget? A law with your seal on it can never be changed!",
   "dir": "smug, sing-song, mock-polite; a nasty little 哦 / 'never' at the end",
   "dur": 7.09,
   "pre": 1.6,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_12",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 2.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_14",
   "t": 153.19,
   "who": "king",
   "voice": "king",
   "maxSec": 3.41,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:14",
   "zh": "唉……我怎么这么糊涂呀！",
   "en": "Oh... how could I be so foolish!",
   "dir": "a long groan of regret, real sorrow, almost tearful",
   "dur": 3.36,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.6,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_13",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_15",
   "t": 159.55,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 5.28,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:16",
   "zh": "王没有办法，只好让人把但以理带到狮子坑。",
   "en": "The king had no choice. Daniel was taken to the lions' den.",
   "dir": "low and serious, but gentle; not scary",
   "dur": 5.23,
   "pre": 2.4,
   "post": 0.3,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_14",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 3.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_16",
   "t": 165.48,
   "who": "king",
   "voice": "king",
   "maxSec": 6.01,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:16",
   "zh": "但以理……你天天侍奉的上帝，一定会救你的！",
   "en": "Daniel... the God you serve every day... He will save you!",
   "dir": "choked up but full of hope; a catch in the voice on 但以理; firm and sure on 一定会救你",
   "dur": 5.96,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_15",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.7
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_17",
   "t": 172.14,
   "who": "daniel",
   "voice": "daniel",
   "maxSec": 5.73,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:16; Psalm 23:4",
   "zh": "王，别怕。上帝和我在一起。",
   "en": "Don't be afraid, Your Majesty. God is with me.",
   "dir": "peaceful, comforting the king; quiet strength, a small smile",
   "dur": 5.68,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_16",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.7
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_18",
   "t": 187.82,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 9.64,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:16-17",
   "zh": "狮子坑里黑黑的。狮子们慢慢走过来……但以理没有害怕，他跪下来祷告。",
   "en": "It was dark in the den. The lions crept closer and closer... but Daniel wasn't afraid. He knelt down and prayed.",
   "dir": "hushed and suspenseful, slow on 慢慢走过来 / 'crept closer'; then calm and warm on 没有害怕 / 'wasn't afraid'",
   "dur": 9.59,
   "pre": 1.2,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_17",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 10.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_19",
   "t": 198.41,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 13.08,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:22",
   "zh": "忽然，一道光照进来！上帝派天使封住了狮子的口。哇——狮子打了个大哈欠，躺下来，像只大猫咪一样呼噜呼噜！",
   "en": "Suddenly, a light shone in! God sent an angel to shut the lions' mouths. And look... the lion gave a great big yawn, lay down, and purred like a giant kitty cat!",
   "dir": "wonder on the light (slow, awed), then a delighted giggle building through 大哈欠 / 'big yawn' to 呼噜呼噜 / 'purred'; playful and happy",
   "dur": 13.03,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_18",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_20",
   "t": 213.24,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 4.62,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:18",
   "zh": "这一夜，王饭也不吃，觉也睡不着。",
   "en": "All night long the king couldn't eat, and he couldn't sleep.",
   "dir": "a little funny-sad, like telling about a grown-up who worries too much",
   "dur": 4.57,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_19",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.8
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_21",
   "t": 219.01,
   "who": "king",
   "voice": "king",
   "maxSec": 8.42,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:18",
   "zh": "唉……但以理怎么样了？睡不着，睡不着啊！",
   "en": "Oh dear... how is Daniel? I can't sleep... I just can't sleep!",
   "dir": "restless, fretting, a big tired sigh; a comic whimper on the second 睡不着 / 'can't sleep'",
   "dur": 8.37,
   "pre": 1.0,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_20",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.2
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_22",
   "t": 230.98,
   "who": "king",
   "voice": "king",
   "maxSec": 6.81,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:19-20",
   "zh": "但以理！但以理！你的上帝……救了你吗？",
   "en": "Daniel! Daniel! Has your God... been able to save you?",
   "dir": "out of breath from running, anxious, calling loudly into the den; voice cracks with worry on the question",
   "dur": 6.76,
   "pre": 3.2,
   "post": 0.6,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_21",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 3.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_23",
   "t": 238.74,
   "who": "daniel",
   "voice": "daniel",
   "maxSec": 8.55,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:21-22",
   "zh": "王啊，我很好！上帝派天使封住了狮子的口，它们一点都没有伤害我！",
   "en": "Your Majesty, I'm fine! God sent His angel to shut the lions' mouths. They didn't hurt me at all!",
   "dir": "joyful and calling up from the den, a happy laugh in it; strong and bright",
   "dur": 8.5,
   "pre": 0.4,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_22",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_24",
   "t": 247.84,
   "who": "king",
   "voice": "king",
   "maxSec": 3.36,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:23",
   "zh": "太好了！快，快把石头搬开！",
   "en": "Wonderful! Quick, quick, roll the stone away!",
   "dir": "huge relief, laughing, bossy-happy; quick 快快 / 'quick, quick'",
   "dur": 3.31,
   "pre": 0.2,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_23",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_25",
   "t": 252.75,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 7.6,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:23",
   "zh": "但以理从狮子坑里走出来，身上一点伤都没有！因为他相信上帝。",
   "en": "Daniel walked out of the lions' den without a single scratch! Because he trusted in God.",
   "dir": "glad, a little amazed; slow and warm on the last sentence",
   "dur": 7.55,
   "pre": 1.4,
   "post": 0.4,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_24",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.6
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_26",
   "t": 261.3,
   "who": "officer",
   "voice": "officer",
   "maxSec": 6.04,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:24 (softened)",
   "zh": "呃……这个……我先走了……",
   "en": "Uh... well... I'll just be going now...",
   "dir": "caught out, nervous, mumbling, trying to sound casual; trails off",
   "dur": 5.99,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 0.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_25",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.0
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_27",
   "t": 267.79,
   "who": "officer",
   "voice": "officer",
   "maxSec": 5.67,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:24 (softened)",
   "zh": "哇啊啊——救命啊！",
   "en": "Waaah! Help!",
   "dir": "a high, comic shriek of fright, cartoon-style; it trails away as he runs",
   "dur": 5.62,
   "pre": 0.3,
   "post": 0.0,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_26",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 0.5
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_28",
   "t": 275.81,
   "who": "king",
   "voice": "king",
   "maxSec": 8.72,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:25-27",
   "zh": "全国的人都听着：但以理的上帝，是活着的上帝！他会救人，他会保护人！",
   "en": "Hear this, everyone in my kingdom! Daniel's God is the living God! He rescues, and He keeps His people safe!",
   "dir": "a king's big proclamation, but joyful, not stern; arms open; strong and ringing",
   "dur": 8.67,
   "pre": 1.0,
   "post": 0.5,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_27",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 2.4
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "da_29",
   "t": 285.58,
   "who": "narrator",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "maxSec": 7.89,
   "ref": "Daniel 6:10; Philippians 4:6",
   "zh": "就算遇到难事，但以理还是一直向上帝祷告。你也可以随时跟上帝说话哦，他一直在听！",
   "en": "Even when things were hard, Daniel kept on praying. You can talk to God any time too. He's always listening!",
   "dir": "warm moral, speaking right to the child; smile on the last sentence",
   "dur": 7.84,
   "pre": 0.6,
   "post": 2.2,
   "anchor": {
    "line": "da_28",
    "edge": "end",
    "dt": 1.1
   }
  }
 ],
